    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were abducted by aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to be studied. Not to be tortured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But because they believe you might be the most patient human alive, and now they want to test that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Most Annoying Game Ever, a puzzle game designed to test your patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't your average brain-teaser. It\u2019s the equivalent of an IQ test, but for your patience. Every interaction, every setting, every mechanic is carefully engineered to waste your time, push your buttons, and make you question why you even clicked &quot;New Game&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits You:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 infuriating puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is uniquely designed to frustrate you in a different way with different themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physical Based Interaction </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to pick up, rotate and throw breakable objects around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/2a78c945b000fc9b56fa4e81ae099442.poster.avif?t=1755670450\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/2a78c945b000fc9b56fa4e81ae099442.webm?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/2a78c945b000fc9b56fa4e81ae099442.mp4?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Annoying Random Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events trigger every few minutes designed to break your flow. Some even block progress unless you solve extra mini-challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/0f70e7eb5d4ccfa3faf20e33d8e2aea3.poster.avif?t=1755670450\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/0f70e7eb5d4ccfa3faf20e33d8e2aea3.webm?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/0f70e7eb5d4ccfa3faf20e33d8e2aea3.mp4?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alien commentary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aliens will try to encourage you. Sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a masochistic puzzle lover or just want to test your patience, this game is built to troll, confuse, frustrate and ultimately entertain you to the fullest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you prove to these aliens that you are the most patient human alive?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were abducted by aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to be studied. Not to be tortured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But because they believe you might be the most patient human alive, and now they want to test that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Most Annoying Game Ever, a puzzle game designed to test your patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't your average brain-teaser. It\u2019s the equivalent of an IQ test, but for your patience. Every interaction, every setting, every mechanic is carefully engineered to waste your time, push your buttons, and make you question why you even clicked &quot;New Game&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Awaits You:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 infuriating puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is uniquely designed to frustrate you in a different way with different themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physical Based Interaction </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to pick up, rotate and throw breakable objects around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/2a78c945b000fc9b56fa4e81ae099442.poster.avif?t=1755670450\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/2a78c945b000fc9b56fa4e81ae099442.webm?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/2a78c945b000fc9b56fa4e81ae099442.mp4?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Annoying Random Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events trigger every few minutes designed to break your flow. Some even block progress unless you solve extra mini-challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/0f70e7eb5d4ccfa3faf20e33d8e2aea3.poster.avif?t=1755670450\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/0f70e7eb5d4ccfa3faf20e33d8e2aea3.webm?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851490/extras/0f70e7eb5d4ccfa3faf20e33d8e2aea3.mp4?t=1755670450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alien commentary</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aliens will try to encourage you. Sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a masochistic puzzle lover or just want to test your patience, this game is built to troll, confuse, frustrate and ultimately entertain you to the fullest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you prove to these aliens that you are the most patient human alive?</p>",
